# System environment

- Operating system: {{ .chezmoi.osRelease.prettyName }}
- Distribution ID: {{ .chezmoi.osRelease.id }}
- Architecture: {{ .chezmoi.arch }}
- Hostname: {{ .chezmoi.hostname }}
- Shell: zsh
- User services are managed with systemd.
- Dotfiles are managed by chezmoi.
- Edit managed dotfiles in the chezmoi source directory rather than editing generated files directly.
- Run `chezmoi apply` after changing the chezmoi source.

{{- if eq .chezmoi.osRelease.id "arch" }}

## Arch Linux

- Use `paru` for official repository packages and prefer Arch Wiki guidance.
{{- else if or (eq .chezmoi.osRelease.id "ubuntu") (eq .chezmoi.osRelease.id "debian") }}

## Debian-based Linux

- Use `apt` for system packages.
{{- else if eq .chezmoi.osRelease.id "fedora" }}

## Fedora Linux

- Use `dnf` for system packages.
{{- else if eq .chezmoi.osRelease.id "alpine" }}

## Alpine Linux

- Use `apk` for system packages.
{{- end }}
